    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d212">

                <pb facs="0443" n="157" xml:id="pg157"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/2379</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">page</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-02-03">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 3, 1916</hi>
                        </date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 7.30 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3703. Passengers and crew <hi rendition="#italic">Kashgar</hi> already dispersed
                    before receipt of your 2786,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d212-f1"/> January 26. Nothing
                    known of reports concerning her or the <hi rendition="#italic">City of
                        Marseilles</hi>.</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
